## Section 2 — Chart Theme Library

**File:** `lib/charts/theme.ts`

### Type definition

```typescript
export interface ChartTheme {
  axis: string          // stroke color for axis lines and ticks
  grid: string          // stroke color for grid lines
  text: string          // fill color for axis labels and legend text
