## Section 6 — Shadow Adjustments Summary

All shadow changes are captured in the merged `.dark` block in Section 1. Summary of what changed and why:

| Shadow | Change | Reason |
|---|---|---|
| `--shadow-soft` | Alpha raised from 0.2/0.15 → 0.3/0.22 | Dark bg absorbs more shadow; cards need visible lift |
| `--shadow-lift` | Added (was absent from Block 2) | Used by CommandPalette, toasts, tooltips — these need to float visibly over dark bg |
| `--shadow-overlay` | Added (was absent from Block 2) | Used by dialogs/modals |
| `--shadow-card`, `--shadow-soft-md` | Unchanged | Block 2 values already adequate |
| `--shadow-card-hover` | Unchanged | Block 2 value includes purple border accent — correct for dark hover |

