### `TokenSwatch` component spec

```tsx
interface TokenSwatchProps {
  name: string           // e.g. "--color-primary"
  background: string     // CSS var reference, e.g. "var(--color-primary)"
  foreground: string     // CSS var reference for the text inside
  label: string          // human-readable label
  contrastPair: {
    bg: string           // token this is typically placed on
    ratio: string        // pre-calculated string, e.g. "5.8:1"
    pass: boolean
  }
}
```

Swatch renders as a rounded card (`rounded-lg p-4`) with:
- Solid fill = `background`
- Token name in `caption` variant in `foreground` color
- Below the card: token name as `text-[11px] text-muted-foreground` + contrast ratio badge (`text-[11px] font-mono`) in green/red based on `pass`

